<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n115274" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψαιστ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψαίω</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>ground,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψ. μᾶζα</span> a cake <i>of ground
			barley</i> mixed with honey and oil, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Int.</u>
				20
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψαιστόν, τό</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέμμα</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόπανον</span>), a <i>cake of this kind,</i> used at
			sacrifices, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				138
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1115
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				206.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Com.Adesp.</u>
				372
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Abst.</u>
				2.15
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				1038.18
			</span></i>(Eleusis, <span class="entity">iv/iii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				4.92
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.190
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Gaet.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				191
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Corn.
			</span></i> Long.): perh. to be written <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψᾳστός</span></b> , cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψᾷστον: σὺν τῷ
				ῑ, ἐκτείνουσι τὸ ᾱ, ὡς Εὐφρόνιος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Lex.Mess.</u>
				p.411
			</span></i>: 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ψαστής.</span>
			</div>
